:''Not to be confused with [[Cyberhorn]].''
'''Metal One Horn ''' (メタルサイボーグ ''Metaru Saibōgu'', '''Metal Cyborg''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of [[One Horn]] found in [[Legend Stages]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. He was added in [[Version 2.1 Update|Version 2.1]].

